  "rulesText": "Ring, Rare (Requires Attunement)\n\nThis ring has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. When you fail a Dexterity saving throw while wearing the ring, you can take a Reaction to expend 1 charge to succeed on that save instead."
